<title>USA: GMAC arranges $75 mln real estate financing.</title>
<headline>GMAC arranges $75 mln real estate financing.</headline>
<dateline>HORSHAM, Pa. 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>General Motors Corp's GMAC Commercial Mortgage said it arranged a $75 million financing with MSGW Real Estate Fund II, a joint venture between Morgan Stanley Real Estate Fund II and Gale &amp; Wentworth.</p>
<p>The arrangement will provide immediate financing for five individual office and industrial buildings in Parsippany, Paramus and Fairfield, N.J., along with a line of credit for financing future commercial office and industrial acquisitions, the General Motors unit said in a statement.</p>
</text>
